        "cooked": "<p>BoardGameGeek has been doing a series of Let's Play videos where their regular game group play a different game each time, this episode it's Sentinels of the Multiverse.</p>\n<p>The video's an hour long and I haven't seen it myself yet but you can catch it <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/thread/1021684/gamenight-episode-19-sentinels-of-the-multiverse\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>More reports after I've seen it</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:05.108Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
