        "raw": "BoardGameGeek has been doing a series of Let&#39;s Play videos where their regular game group play a different game each time, this episode it&#39;s Sentinels of the Multiverse.\n\nThe video&#39;s an hour long and I haven&#39;t seen it myself yet but you can catch it [url=http://www.boardgamegeek.com/thread/1021684/gamenight-episode-19-sentinels-of-the-multiverse ]here[/url]. \n\n&nbsp;\n\n More reports after I&#39;ve seen it \n",
